00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,918
听：A Woman Doctor-Lina.

2
00:00:01,918 --> 00:00:03,836
跟读：A Woman Doctor-Lina.

3
00:00:03,836 --> 00:00:24,812
听：Born in a pigs’ nest, Lina led a poor life in her childhood. She was looked down upon by the children of her generation. But she intended to become a doctor after she came across Lin Qiaozhi by chance, who was delivering medical courses to an audience crowding around her.

4
00:00:24,812 --> 00:00:45,788
跟读：Born in a pigs’ nest, Lina led a poor life in her childhood. She was looked down upon by the children of her generation. But she intended to become a doctor after she came across Lin Qiaozhi by chance, who was delivering medical courses to an audience crowding around her.

5
00:00:45,788 --> 00:01:03,312
听：Before moving off, Lin inspired her to carry on her study. With Lin’s support, Lina entered an institute and studied hard sparing no time for entertainment. Her being outspoken and modest won respect for her.

6
00:01:03,312 --> 00:01:20,837
跟读：Before moving off, Lin inspired her to carry on her study. With Lin’s support, Lina entered an institute and studied hard sparing no time for entertainment. Her being outspoken and modest won respect for her.

7
00:01:20,837 --> 00:01:38,232
听：Her excellent arguing skills and observation ability put others into the shade. Now, Lina has become a specialist in medical emergencies. Her kindness and considerate behavior to the poor were well known.

8
00:01:38,232 --> 00:01:55,628
跟读：Her excellent arguing skills and observation ability put others into the shade. Now, Lina has become a specialist in medical emergencies. Her kindness and considerate behavior to the poor were well known.

9
00:01:55,628 --> 00:02:17,652
听：The organization she founded carried out campaigns and welfare projects to help cut the death rate for the poor. Her job was hard but worthwhile. She often refers to the connection between her achievement and Lin Qiaozhi, and says that her poor childhood is the bond between her and the poor.

